<div class="gap-bottom-equal edu-about-area about-style-9" style="background:#0060ff2e; padding: 60px 10px;">
    <div class="container edublink-animated-shape">
        <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">

            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div class="about-content">
                    <div class="section-title section-left sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">

                        <h2 class="title">Why Choose Australia for Study?</h2>
                        <span class="shape-line"><i class="icon-19"></i></span>

                    </div>
                    <ul class="features-list sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            World's Top Universities
                            <p class="fs-5">Australia is home to 6 universities ranked among the world’s top 100. These institutions provide high-quality education, global recognition, and strong academic reputations, attracting students from around the world seeking best career outcomes.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Wide Range of Academic Programs
                            <p class="fs-5">With over 40 universities, Australia offers a vast array of academic programs in fields like science, arts, business, and technology. This diversity allows students to pursue their interests and customize their education to match personal and professional goals.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Internships & Jobs
                            <p class="fs-5">Many Australian universities offer internships and part-time paid employment opportunities. These experiences help students gain practical skills, industry exposure, and financial support while studying.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            More Than 15 Nobel Laureates
                            <p class="fs-5">More than 15 Nobel laureates have graduated from Australian universities, highlighting the country's strong academic tradition. This legacy of excellence reflects the quality of education and research, inspiring students to strive for innovation and global impact.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Innovative Research Facilities
                            <p class="fs-5">Australia invests heavily in modern infrastructure and world-class research facilities. Students benefit from access to advanced labs, libraries, and technology, fostering innovation, collaboration, and high-level academic achievements.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Cultural Diversity
                            <p class="fs-5">With a population speaking over 200 languages, Australia is one of the world’s most multicultural countries. Students experience a welcoming environment that encourages cross-cultural understanding.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Nature & Wildlife
                            <p class="fs-5">Australia is famous for its stunning natural landscapes, from beaches to rainforests, and its unique wildlife. Students enjoy a healthy outdoor lifestyle and opportunities to explore the country’s biodiversity, making their study experience.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Student-Friendly Cities
                            <p class="fs-5"> Seven Australian cities, including Melbourne and Sydney, consistently rank among the most student-friendly globally. They offer excellent public transport, safety, entertainment, and job opportunities, creating a supportive, vibrant environment.</p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

